WEBVTT

00:01:32.930 --> 00:01:34.160
Thank you
for waiting.

00:01:46.610 --> 00:01:48.340
Th-Thank you,
come again.

00:01:51.940 --> 00:01:53.760
ls this...
for me?

00:01:54.610 --> 00:01:55.350
Yes.

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:05.930
What a beautiful brooch!

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:07.820
It meets with
your approval?

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:09.230
I'm so happy!

00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:12.640
But Godai, why would you
give me a Christmas present?

00:02:13.640 --> 00:02:15.620
Yes. Well. Actually...

00:02:16.310 --> 00:02:17.100
Actually?

00:02:17.980 --> 00:02:19.270
It represents my...

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:21.210
...love!

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:28.540
Oh, Godai! I'll reveal everything:.
I've admired you from afar!

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:32.140
You really mean it!?

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:40.430
- - What a weirdo!
- - Oddball.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:42.640
Stay away from him.

00:02:46.670 --> 00:02:49.920
It's been a month since the new
manager came to Maison Ikkoku.

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:53.620
And the entire town i's
awash with Christmas cheer.

00:02:54.350 --> 00:02:57.650
I spent almost all of my living
allowance on this present.

00:02:58.020 --> 00:02:59.750
And I MUST
give it to her!

00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:13.980
Shake! Shake! Shake!

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:17.100
I said shake! Shake!

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:19.210
You don't know
how to shake?

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:22.090
- - Welcome home.
- - Hiya.

00:03:22.710 --> 00:03:24.790
Suppertime, Soichiro.

00:03:28.050 --> 00:03:29.310
Bad dog!

00:03:30.370 --> 00:03:32.780
No supper for you!

00:03:34.390 --> 00:03:37.520
Hey, Manager!
I think he's senile.

00:03:38.390 --> 00:03:41.820
It's only natural. No one ever
taught Soichiro any tricks.

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:44.860
That's no fun...

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:48.730
Kentaro! Quit wasting time!
Get your homework done!

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:54.390
M-Mr. Yotsuya...

00:03:54.740 --> 00:03:58.960
He so rarely goes off to work,
and he's back so soon.

00:04:05.090 --> 00:04:07.810
- - Salutations.
- - W-Welcome back...

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:10.730
What a fine dog!

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:12.650
Shiro! Shiro!

00:04:13.090 --> 00:04:14.550
I have a candy stick for you.

00:04:14.760 --> 00:04:16.750
Hey! Soichiro...!

00:04:19.430 --> 00:04:21.440
A fine dog!

00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:24.060
Well, I must be off.

00:04:24.430 --> 00:04:27.980
What kind of work
does that man do?

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:31.470
Kotaro?

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:36.790
Kotaro, I'll have some
fish bones for you later.

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:40.950
Shiro...
Kotaro...

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:46.830
Your name is Soichiro!

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:48.530
Hey, Mique!

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:50.170
Look, Mique!
Food!

00:04:53.120 --> 00:04:54.530
Hey, Manager!

00:04:55.800 --> 00:04:57.500
I said, hey, Manager!

00:04:57.810 --> 00:04:59.420
What! What do you want!?

00:04:59.810 --> 00:05:02.090
Jeez, what's your problem!?

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:04.690
Sorry! Nothing!
C-Can I help you?

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:06.930
They're predicting rain.

00:05:07.150 --> 00:05:11.400
My roof is a sieve. The old manager
wouldn't do anything.

00:05:12.150 --> 00:05:13.430
I'll take care of it.

00:05:24.830 --> 00:05:28.110
Honestly! He doesn't even
care what his own name is!

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:30.510
He's so dumb!

00:05:31.170 --> 00:05:33.680
Maybe I should let
Kentaro train him.

00:05:35.510 --> 00:05:39.290
Soichiro... Please understand
what I'm feeling!

00:05:46.520 --> 00:05:50.090
Kyoko is right above me.

00:05:51.180 --> 00:05:52.830
I wonder how old she is.

00:05:53.860 --> 00:05:55.760
I wonder if
she has a boyfriend.

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:02.860
Hey! I love you!

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:06.880
W-What!? When did
you get here?

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:10.320
Who cares about that, Godai?

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:14.610
I came to buy a cup noodle,
but now I don't have to.

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:17.030
I'll get it for free, right?

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:20.950
No way! This is my food
for the whole month!

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:22.630
Oh, really?

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:24.760
''Hey! I love you! ''

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:28.810
Thank you!
What a nice guy!

00:06:30.230 --> 00:06:31.540
Get out!

00:06:32.230 --> 00:06:35.700
- - The roof that you love so much...
- - What about the roof?

00:06:36.240 --> 00:06:37.670
'S got a boyfriend.

00:07:07.930 --> 00:07:09.170
Hey. Stupid.

00:07:09.930 --> 00:07:13.420
The manager pettin' you...
ain't you got it good.

00:07:14.610 --> 00:07:18.240
But she's got a boyfriend?
I don't believe it!

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:21.560
Stupid! Does she
have a boyfriend?

00:07:21.940 --> 00:07:24.500
You know, don't you?
Don't hide it! Tell me!

00:07:24.940 --> 00:07:27.110
Tell me, Stupid!

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:29.430
I'm not moving until you talk!

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:31.780
Moron.

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:38.930
Hey, Manager!
Is the roof fixed?

00:07:42.970 --> 00:07:46.680
Hey, the rain's comin'!
Is it fixed?

00:07:49.630 --> 00:07:51.010
Maybe she fell.

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:18.220
You'll catch cold, Manager.

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:22.670
She's sound asleep.

00:08:24.010 --> 00:08:26.630
Yeah! Now's my chance
to give her the present!

00:09:03.050 --> 00:09:04.510
Here I come...

00:09:13.390 --> 00:09:14.430
Soichiro...

00:09:17.400 --> 00:09:19.740
''S-Soichiro''!?

00:09:23.070 --> 00:09:25.650
Ah! Rain! I've got to
bring in my laundry!

00:09:26.070 --> 00:09:27.960
Hey! You're on the roof!

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:34.870
Th-Thank you.

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:35.900
Sure.

00:09:38.090 --> 00:09:39.220
Looks like rain.

00:09:58.770 --> 00:10:00.820
She slapped me!

00:10:02.110 --> 00:10:04.920
Do guys usually get
slapped just For a Feel?

00:10:05.780 --> 00:10:07.040
Hold it a second!

00:10:07.780 --> 00:10:11.120
Maybe she's just being
faithful to that Soichiro guy!

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:17.110
Hey, Manager!

00:10:17.450 --> 00:10:19.540
Kentaro. Did you
finish your homework?

00:10:20.130 --> 00:10:23.120
Yup! When the rain stops,
can I go play with Soichiro?

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:24.300
Sure!

00:10:27.130 --> 00:10:29.150
I hope it stops soon!

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:49.680
Kidnapper! Kidnapper!

00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:51.360
What are you saying?

00:10:51.820 --> 00:10:53.910
You know Soichiro
don't you?

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:55.490
He's my friend!

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:57.520
What? He's a
grade-school student?

00:10:58.170 --> 00:11:00.180
No, he's a lot older than that.

00:11:01.500 --> 00:11:03.300
What kinda guy is he!?
Tell me!

00:11:04.840 --> 00:11:06.390
What's the hand for?

00:11:08.510 --> 00:11:09.820
I get it.

00:11:11.510 --> 00:11:12.700
Don't waste it.

00:11:13.840 --> 00:11:16.870
Not cup noodles!
You know what I want!

00:11:19.520 --> 00:11:23.240
Come to the park later.
I'll introduce you to Soichiro.

00:12:02.220 --> 00:12:04.540
So you're Soichiro, huh?

00:12:37.670 --> 00:12:40.540
Soichiro

00:12:41.330 --> 00:12:42.740
That should do it.

00:12:44.010 --> 00:12:47.640
You're named after the man
who means the most to me.

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:51.650
Just as long
as you understand.

00:12:56.680 --> 00:12:58.760
I want to be a dog!

00:12:59.690 --> 00:13:00.740
Now's my chance!

00:13:05.690 --> 00:13:07.270
Come join the party!

00:13:07.350 --> 00:13:08.720
A Christmas party?

00:13:09.700 --> 00:13:11.690
2000 yen gets you
food and drinks!

00:13:12.030 --> 00:13:14.280
Just the usual gang,
so you can relax.

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:16.600
Those are fun every so often.

00:13:22.370 --> 00:13:24.950
You coming, too? 3000 yen for guys.
It's cheap.

00:13:25.370 --> 00:13:29.240
Impossible! I'm on the exam
home stretch. I got no time.

00:13:30.050 --> 00:13:31.600
You have your life to live.

00:13:31.720 --> 00:13:33.180
Well then, Manager...?

00:13:33.720 --> 00:13:36.440
2000 yen, was it? Here.

00:13:37.390 --> 00:13:38.990
Thank you.

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:44.800
But you deserve a break, right?

00:13:46.070 --> 00:13:47.180
We'll see you there.

00:13:47.400 --> 00:13:48.540
Have a good day!

00:13:49.740 --> 00:13:52.780
Now I've blown
my entire month's allowance!

00:13:53.740 --> 00:13:55.870
And on this...
And on this...

00:13:56.410 --> 00:13:58.370
It's been so long
since I've been to a party.

00:14:03.740 --> 00:14:05.420
This is it!
My only chance!

00:14:06.420 --> 00:14:07.470
Um, Manager...?

00:14:07.760 --> 00:14:08.690
What is it?

00:14:09.420 --> 00:14:10.850
Yes. Well.

00:14:11.760 --> 00:14:12.690
Actually...

00:14:16.760 --> 00:14:19.540
Hey, Manager! Manager!

00:14:20.100 --> 00:14:21.830
Here's your
Christmas present!

00:14:22.770 --> 00:14:24.600
Please, take it!

00:14:27.440 --> 00:14:28.520
ls this for me?

00:14:30.100 --> 00:14:32.120
It was a door prize
from the department store.

00:14:33.450 --> 00:14:35.320
But why would you
give me a present?

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:38.100
Because I really like you.

00:14:38.450 --> 00:14:41.760
Thank you.
I really like you, too.

00:14:43.120 --> 00:14:43.790
Really?

00:14:44.120 --> 00:14:45.150
Really.

00:14:45.450 --> 00:14:46.690
Really really?

00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:48.470
Really really!

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:52.240
Oh, that's right. Did you
want something, Mr. Ronin?

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:54.580
No, I'll come back later.

00:15:12.820 --> 00:15:17.890
Kids've got it easy. I'd like
to say it like that, just once.

00:15:23.490 --> 00:15:26.600
Chachamaru

00:15:33.170 --> 00:15:35.620
Drink up, and keep
the party lively!

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:38.680
This is really great tonight!

00:15:39.180 --> 00:15:40.440
You got that right!

00:15:40.850 --> 00:15:42.990
- - Yotsuya.
- - What could you want?

00:15:43.520 --> 00:15:46.120
- - Trade seats with me?
- - Forget it.

00:15:47.190 --> 00:15:50.870
You're a looker!
You're really a looker!

00:15:51.530 --> 00:15:54.450
You're too good
to be a manager!

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:56.470
Miss Clock Hill Town!

00:15:57.870 --> 00:15:59.510
You've got a boyfriend, right?

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:02.320
No! No, I don't.

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:05.320
She doesn't?
That means...

00:16:06.200 --> 00:16:08.200
I can make my move!

00:16:10.870 --> 00:16:13.240
You're gonna dump
your family?

00:16:13.550 --> 00:16:18.120
I'll dump them all!
I'd die for little Kyoko!

00:16:18.890 --> 00:16:21.140
Die, you middle-aged delinquent!
Yotsuya?

00:16:21.560 --> 00:16:23.080
No trading seats.

00:16:26.560 --> 00:16:28.990
- - This was my idea.
- - Of course.

00:16:29.220 --> 00:16:32.040
Little Kyoko, you're
abandoning a lonely old man!

00:16:32.900 --> 00:16:36.080
The middle-aged are a caution.
I will protect you.

00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:37.490
Yotsuya!

00:16:39.240 --> 00:16:40.580
Hello!

00:16:40.910 --> 00:16:42.050
C'mon in.

00:16:42.240 --> 00:16:44.220
- - Hey, Manager!
- - Kentaro!

00:16:48.240 --> 00:16:50.200
Hey! Hands off!

00:16:50.580 --> 00:16:53.680
The Manager is gonna
marry ME! Don't touch her!

00:16:54.580 --> 00:16:55.550
Way t'go!

00:16:55.580 --> 00:16:57.600
What a cute couple.

00:17:11.600 --> 00:17:12.890
Well then, I'll be going...

00:17:12.930 --> 00:17:14.250
It's only nine o'clock.

00:17:14.600 --> 00:17:16.780
Someone has to
watch the fort.

00:17:17.280 --> 00:17:18.890
I'll be going, too.

00:17:21.950 --> 00:17:24.640
The break is over.
Have to hit the books!

00:17:27.290 --> 00:17:28.280
This time for sure!

00:17:31.290 --> 00:17:32.450
Thanks for taking him.

00:17:32.620 --> 00:17:34.140
He's in good hands.

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:40.350
Hey, ronin! Don't try any
funny stuff on the way home!

00:17:47.640 --> 00:17:49.280
Uh, Manager, do you
want me to carry him?

00:17:49.640 --> 00:17:51.830
I hate piggyback
rides from guys.

00:17:51.980 --> 00:17:53.730
It's all right. He's light.

00:18:29.020 --> 00:18:30.220
Dammit!

00:18:31.350 --> 00:18:34.720
I never gave it to her!
And it would have been so easy!

00:18:36.680 --> 00:18:38.180
I'm pathetic!

00:19:03.050 --> 00:19:05.270
''Jingle Bells... ''

00:19:08.060 --> 00:19:10.430
''Jingle Bells... ''

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:38.830
- - Get out! This is my room!
- - W-What? What did l...

00:19:39.410 --> 00:19:40.970
- - Oww!
- - Get out!

00:19:42.760 --> 00:19:43.430
Lecher!

00:19:51.090 --> 00:19:53.710
Hey, open up!
This is my room!

00:19:54.090 --> 00:19:54.800
Open up!

00:19:55.770 --> 00:19:57.060
Open up!
Lemme in!

00:19:57.090 --> 00:19:58.330
What's wrong?

00:19:59.100 --> 00:20:01.590
M-Manager...!
l... I seem to have, uh...

00:20:07.780 --> 00:20:09.580
Akemi! Akemi!

00:20:12.450 --> 00:20:13.530
She's not waking up.

00:20:14.110 --> 00:20:15.700
She was pretty drunk.

00:20:51.490 --> 00:20:52.410
Sorry about this.

00:20:54.160 --> 00:20:55.530
Nothing else we could do.

00:21:03.160 --> 00:21:06.680
The gods have smiled on me!
Now's my chance!

00:21:13.510 --> 00:21:14.710
It's about time.

00:21:16.180 --> 00:21:18.700
The tea. It gets bitter
if it steeps too long.

00:21:19.520 --> 00:21:20.850
Th-That's true.

00:21:24.180 --> 00:21:26.330
Why? Why can't
I say anything?

00:21:30.530 --> 00:21:31.390
Here.

00:21:31.860 --> 00:21:32.680
Thanks.

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:42.010
Let's play a game.

00:21:42.870 --> 00:21:44.020
Let's!

00:21:49.220 --> 00:21:54.100
I got this from Kentaro.
A Christmas present, he says.

00:22:32.930 --> 00:22:35.070
This i's no good!
I have to...

00:22:35.590 --> 00:22:37.180
M-Manager, l...

00:22:37.260 --> 00:22:38.250
Yes?

00:22:41.930 --> 00:22:42.590
Actually...

00:22:42.590 --> 00:22:43.450
Yes?

00:22:52.950 --> 00:22:55.110
Isn't this the bathroom?

00:22:55.610 --> 00:22:58.280
Here. Just hang in there
a few more seconds. I'll take you.

00:23:08.620 --> 00:23:11.240
What's the matter with me!?

00:23:17.300 --> 00:23:18.470
Snow... ?

00:23:28.980 --> 00:23:31.430
Tomorrow, I'll give
it to her, for sure!

00:23:38.330 --> 00:23:44.950
to be continued...

00:23:49.660 --> 00:23:52.850
It's awful! Godai's entrance
exams have finally started!

00:23:53.330 --> 00:23:55.530
But everyone is
trying to distract him...

00:23:56.010 --> 00:23:57.710
Next on Maison Ikkoku:.

00:23:58.010 --> 00:24:00.840
''Hearts on Fire in the Dark!
All Alone with Kyoko. ''

00:24:01.340 --> 00:24:03.590
Oh, my! The clock bell
started ringing!

00:24:04.020 --> 00:24:05.720
You can do it, Godai!
